	(text "feather_sensor_template rev 0.1 - one sensor board per nRF54L15 feather, stacked underneath, linked by CN1 (14-way FFC).\nSensor Connector: CN1 + host-side parts (VSENS decoupling, R_ID).  Isolation: ADuM1250 + NXE1S0303MC across the barrier.\nSensor: the board-specific circuit on the isolated side (empty in the template).  See README.md."
